---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy · plnt"
  description="What the plnt software, this website and the public playground do with data."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <div class="container prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: September 25, 2026</p>

    <h2>The software</h2>
    <p>
      plnt is open-source software you run yourself. It sends no telemetry, analytics or crash
      reports to us. It talks only to the model servers you configure (for example your own
      Ollama server, or an API such as Gemini or OpenAI), and to whatever services your bundles'
      tools call. What it stores (conversations, events, usage, audit logs, secrets) stays in
      <code>$PLNT_HOME</code> on your machine. What those model providers do with requests is set
      by their own terms.
    </p>

    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>
      This site has no analytics, no cookies and no tracking scripts. Our hosting provider keeps
      standard request logs (IP address, time, URL, user agent) for operating and securing the
      service.
    </p>

    <h2>The public playground</h2>
    <p>
      The <a href="/playground">playground</a> is a real plnt server. When you use it:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Your messages, and the agent's steps and replies, are stored by that server as ordinary
        plnt events, and are sent to the model provider the server is configured with to
        generate replies.
      </li>
      <li>
        Your IP address is held in memory for rate limiting, and appears in the server's
        request logs.
      </li>
      <li>
        Conversations are private to your browser tab: each one is protected by a random
        token that only your tab holds. The server's operators can read them.
      </li>
      <li>We may delete playground data at any time, and do not keep it longer than needed to run and debug the demo.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Don't type personal, health, payment or other sensitive information into the playground.</strong> The demo businesses are fictional.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions or deletion requests: open an issue on
      <a href="https://github.com/plnt-work/plnt/issues">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
